1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:01,900
Three questions people

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,833
ask us about biomass.

3
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:04,800
One.

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,067
Can I sell

5
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:09,233
biomass without a factory?

6
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:10,533
Yes.

7
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:12,700
Many people collect,

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,767
bale and store crop residue,

9
00:00:15,767 --> 00:00:19,667
and supply pellet makers and plants.

10
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:21,867
That is aggregation,

11
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:24,733
a business on its own.

12
00:00:25,033 --> 00:00:25,433
Two.

13
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:26,933
Why does the price

14
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:28,500
change so much?

15
00:00:28,733 --> 00:00:29,367
Season,

16
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:30,000
region,

17
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,700
quality and distance.

18
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,867
Straw is cheap at harvest

19
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:36,200
and costly months later.

20
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,100
Three.

21
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,467
How do I find

22
00:00:38,467 --> 00:00:41,233
buyers outside my district?

23
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:41,933
Today,

24
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:43,967
mostly through contacts and calls.

25
00:00:43,967 --> 00:00:45,433
That is exactly the gap

26
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:46,933
we are working on.

27
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,100
Have a question?

28
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,567
Drop it in the comments.

29
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:50,967
IndiaBiomass.

30
00:00:50,967 --> 00:00:54,067
Connecting India's biomass economy.
